<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian coffee temperature and rain detailed.</title>
<headline>Brazilian coffee temperature and rain detailed.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian coffee region temperatures (centigrade) and rain (millimeters) in the 24 hours to 1200 GMT.</p>
<p>Parana State: Londrina 21.0, Nil, maringa 21.8, Nil, Umuarama 23.9, Nil, Paranavai 21.5, Not Available.</p>
<p>Sao Paulo State: Presidente Prudente 23.5, Nil, Franca 18.5, 6.9 mm, Votuporanga 21.9, 0.2 mm, Catanduva 21.0, 0.2 mm, Sao Carlos 19.8, 26.6 mm, Simao 21.0, Nil.</p>
<p>Minas Gerais State: Pocos de Caldas 17.0, 11.0 mm, Guaxupe 18.0, 17.0 mm.</p>
</text>
